'''Meatballs''' are grotesque enemies found only in [[Chapter 4]]. They slowly slide around the room aimlessly. If Isaac is in sight, they will stop to spew a fountain of short-range blood shots in all directions or spit a line of damaging [[Creep#Red Creep|Red Creep]] towards Isaac. Upon death, they spawn a {{e|Host}}, which can be faintly seen partially sticking out of the Meatball on one side.

