== Trivia ==
* Meatballs are one of five enemies (four without Repentance, three without Afterbirth+) in the game that uses [[Creep]] as projectiles, the others are {{e|Conjoined Fatty}}, {{e|Bloaty}}, {{e|Ultra Pride}} and {{e|The Thing}}.
* Meatballs are one of two only enemies from the Afterbirth expansion that are entirely new enemies and not new variants of already existing enemies. The other is the {{e|Corn Mine}}. The {{e|Dukie}} is an exception as it's technically a smaller version of {{e|The Duke of Flies}}.
* {{dlc|a+}} Meatballs now make sounds when they attack.
* {{dlc|a+}} Prior to [[Booster Packs#Booster Pack #5|Booster Pack #5]], Meatballs had a chance to spawn {{e|Mushroom}}s upon death instead of {{e|Host}}s.

